{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52897","headline":"真妄偈 · 本净","name":"真妄偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷（《景德传灯录》作「推」）真真无相，穷妄妄无形。\n返观推穷心，知心亦假名。\n会道既（《景德传灯录》作「亦」）如此，到头亦只宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}